    "kind": "top1_lowrank_router.rs_Top1RouterQat",
    "note": "hidden = input_projection @ x + input_bias; raw = expert_projection @ hidden + expert_bias; expert = argmax(raw) (lowest-index tiebreak); input x is the RAW pre-norm residual (NOT the fake-quant activation); all router weights are f32 (router is not ternarized). This is the deployed gbf-model router, NOT s8's simplified flat [E,d_model] router."
